For your project, I would build **SAA (Smart Automated Assistant)** as a complete, multi-user SaaS platform for automated video management, AI-powered content preparation, social media publishing, and performance analysis.

The goal is bigger than a simple video scheduler.

I envision it as an **all-in-one Social Media Automation & Intelligence Platform** where any person or business can:

1. Create an account.
2. Connect their social media accounts.
3. Upload videos or connect Google Drive.
4. Let AI analyze their content.
5. Automatically prepare platform-specific content.
6. Schedule or automatically publish videos.
7. Track performance across platforms.
8. Understand what works and what doesn't.
9. Improve their publishing strategy using actual performance data.

And importantly, this must be a real SaaS product, not a personal dashboard built around your own channels.

Every registered user gets an independent workspace, private data, their own connected accounts, schedules, videos, analytics, and settings.

